{"ref":"BDB, שְׁרֵקָה","hw":"שְׁרֵקָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁרֵקָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f.</strong> (object of derisive) <strong>hissing</strong>;—always abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span>, and always + <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁמָּה</span>: <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 19:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.19.8\">Je 19:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 25:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.25.9\">25:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 25:18\" href=\"/Jeremiah.25.18\">18</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">חָרְבָּה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">קְלָלָה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 29:18\" href=\"/Jeremiah.29.18\">29:18</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">אָלָה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶרְפָּה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:37\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.37\">51:37</a> <a data-ref=\"Micah 6:16\" href=\"/Micah.6.16\">Mi 6:16</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶרְפָּה</span>), <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 29:8\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.29.8\">2 Ch 29:8</a>.","next":"BDB, שְׁרִיקָה","prev":"BDB, שָׁרַק"}